000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,1.5,8,120,120,18,1Style: OP13-Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:39.77,Title,,0,0,230,,The Execution PlatformDialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Ace is alive!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Was that Ace's brother?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:02:58.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I almost passed out!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:08.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Like Pops and Red Hair he used Conqueror's Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Was he the one who did it?Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:15.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like he used it unconsciously.Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that he had such tremendous power!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:30.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He was born with it as I thought!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He uses it, too!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Back down if your heart is weak!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:37.93,Main,,0,0,0,,He is not just another rookie!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.93,0:03:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's not surprising because he's the son of Dragon the revolutionary!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Doberman!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, where did you get the power from?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What power?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.01,0:03:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Never mind!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:55.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's not aware of it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:57.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So it's not ready to be used!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:00.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But it's no wonder that he attracts people!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:04.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is why they say "blood will tell," Dragon!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape this battlefield! If you do, he'll prove a formidable foe for us!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure he dies!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get Whitebeard first!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a monster but he's wounded badly! Bring him down at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,From now on, back Straw Hat Luffy up...Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:43.85,Main,,0,0,0,,with all your strength!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's brother?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:58.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy! Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:03.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You're...Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,the allied pirate of Whitebeard, Bohemian Knight Doma!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:10.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Vice Admiral Momonga!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:18.98,Main,,0,0,0,,DeCalvan Brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You got to fight...!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Against us!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Thunder Lord McGuy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:28.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I need you to fight me, Vice Admiral Doberman!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Is this...?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We pirates from the New World will assist you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-chan's right there! Let's go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.49,0:05:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The allied pirates of Whitebeard are surrounding Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Ace's brother!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy forces are focusing on Pops now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,This is your only chance to get beyond the admirals!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's break through all at once! Come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal, Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The world's greatest pirate is putting you to the test!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Heehaw!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:20.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard put all his hopes on you! That's a big thing!Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:25.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to respond to his expectations?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what Whitebeard wants!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,But I came here for...Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,only one reason, right from the start!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates are gaining vigor!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.31,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna break through! We need more troops!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral-dono! Let's get Straw Hat first...!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:50.66,Main,,0,0,0,,They left Whitebeard alone! Attack Whitebeard now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:54.35,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can bring Whitebeard down, we can stop all of them!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:07:01.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They think that they can beat me if they attack me all at one time!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:18.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard! Is he invincible?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:23.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Do it, brat!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:27.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You just stopped them from executing Ace on my behalf!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:31.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You have the middle initial D,Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:36.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,so show me how the world will be in years to come!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:38.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Eye!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Heads up, Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:47.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you...?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:52.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the president's order! We consider the Navy as our enemy for now! Go!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Daz Bones, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You're sleeping too much, Mr. 1!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I got out of shape by being in prison.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need you here, Straw Hat! Off you go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you standing in my way, Crocodile?Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:42.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the best mood now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So you better watch yourself, Hawk Eye!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to help you, too!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot Monkey D. Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock. Friendly operative. Abort attack.Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a Warlord, aren't you, Boa Hancock?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:25.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep stopping the Pacifistas?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:27.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you were on the Government's side!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You're such a senseless man! You don't know anything!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you one thing.Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Love is always a hurricane!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:49.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The scaffold is close now, Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You just run straight!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:53.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Now is our chance to do it.Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:03.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that you must do this when you're not fully recovered.Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But we need you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, Iva-san.Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Crab-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Inazuma of the Revolutionary Army! He did it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:52.43,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a bridge! Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is heading straight towards the scaffold!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Do something or he'll reach it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:00.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't! These pirates aren't letting us by!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Gah! Use guns! Fire at Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Th-They are...Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:29.49,Main,,0,0,0,,commanders of the Whitebeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's brother! Just run straight, don't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:43.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Break through all at once!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him pass through!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,...Battle Axe!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:13.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun, go ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him go!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Death Wink!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No one will pass by here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:32.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Just advance, Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat will make it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Keep going!Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:40.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Yank Straw Hat down!Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:43.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Set Ace free!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:51.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that you used that kid as a trump card, Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,But I won't let him go any further!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stay quiet and watch?Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.81,0:13:23.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:47.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Garp the Hero!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandpa! Move out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:55.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to move!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a vice admiral of the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:05.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been fighting against pirates since long before you were born!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna pass through here, you have to kill me first!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:22.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Because of the path you two...Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,have chosen to live!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:36.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta find a way, Straw Hat-boy! Hurry up before the bridge collapses!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:48.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.47,0:15:03.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you want me to fight with these guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.23,Main,,0,0,0,,That's your training!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.87,Main,,0,0,0,,My training?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It just makes me hungry and I don't wanna get hit anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a baby!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:29.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got to become the strongest Navy soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become a pirate, not a Navy soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:37.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:41.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:45.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing's more painful than Grandpa's fist!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do it, Grandpa! Move out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:57.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If you can't, Ace will die!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Things don't always go as you want! I'm not gonna have mercy on you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I consider you...Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,my enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:28.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's wrong with me?! This isn't the time to...Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:33.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pops, my brother and my crew...Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:35.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,are falling, and yet...Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:41.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy... my tears won't stop...Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:46.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Even now that it's come to this... I want to live...Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You're their parent after all, Garp.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:14.46,Main,,0,0,0,,He is about to get to the scaffold!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You called him a reckless piece of crap!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:21.94,Main,,0,0,0,,He is reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he will free Fire Fist Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Get lost! You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not careful.Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:39.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:18:59.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take this.Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:03.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is the key to your brother's handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I have the key!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you...Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:41.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! Fleet Admiral Sengoku is using his power!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:42.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it before!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't get away from me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:57.74,Main,,0,0,0,,A giant Buddha!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that you even have such a thing, Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the key!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:16.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Aim at them and be ready to fire at a moment's notice!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.40,Main,,0,0,0,,No way, the key...!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:26.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a serious criminal who should be punished by death, too!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna execute both of you brothers with my own bare hands!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that? I passed out all of a sudden...Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:49.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat... Oh!Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Three! Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Three! Protect Ace with a wall!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:12.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Giant Balloon!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:18.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Candle Wall!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:23.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he expanding?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:36.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The scaffold is collapsing!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:37.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.23,0:21:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:42.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We're falling!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.73,0:21:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make the key! Uncuff him right away!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:53.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! There's Brother Three!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:58.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What is he doing in that ridiculous costume?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought he ran away from here already!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.99,0:22:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the other guy?! What's taking him so long?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.66,0:22:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Since it was such short notice, he's having trouble getting ready...Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.57,0:22:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.82,0:22:17.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:31.57,Main,,0,0,0,,If I tell you that I'm here out of respect for my late comrade,Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.57,0:22:34.43,Main,,0,0,0,,are you going to laugh at me?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.48,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I won't!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:41.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Blow them away!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Save your brother, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:03.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.50,0:23:06.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.11,0:23:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Three!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.75,0:23:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They all got hit!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist can't use his power because of the seastone handcuffs!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.35,0:23:18.70,Main,,0,0,0,,He's dead!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,And we got Straw Hat, too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:40.28,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a tunnel of fire in the smoke!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always been like this!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:45.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You've never even listened to me...Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.37,0:23:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,and always done such crazy things!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Good!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.58,0:24:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.28,0:24:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and Brother Three are alive, too!Dialogu